# Sethos Lauma Fischl Mona. ~16s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Sethos Hex Quickbloom (barely). Sethos uses 1 Shadowpiericng shot into E 8N2W E. C0 Mona is loses ~16K DPS. No burst Lauma.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
sethos char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
